       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. LNKD.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-SELF       PIC X(8).
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01 DFHCOMMAREA.
          05 LK-NAME    PIC X(8).
          05 LK-REST    PIC X(4).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN.
           MOVE LK-NAME TO WS-SELF.
           IF LK-REST = 'Z'
               EXEC CICS XCTL PROGRAM(WS-SELF) END-EXEC
           END-IF.
           EXEC CICS RETURN END-EXEC.
